WEBVTT

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.610
<b>School festival
is approaching</b>

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:04.230
Attractions

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.440
Today, I'd like for us to decide what
we're gonna do for the school festival.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:11.410
Each class has to do a
snack stand and one other thing.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.240
How about a maid café?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.580
Our Brass Band Club is already doing that,
so there'd be two of them.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.790
Forget that. Let's do a play!

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.870
After all, we've got our prince right here!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.040
Our class doesn't have enough people
to run two things at the same time.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.170
Some of us will have to
participate in both, I guess.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.800
Yeah.

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:30.420
The highlight of the festival
is the B-grade gourmet competition

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.550
that all the snack stands participate in, right?

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.390
How about a stand for potatoes
that are steamed just right?!

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.520
It should be fried chicken
rather than potatoes, right?

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.350
Eren?

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.600
We'll do cheeseburgers!

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:15.780
Period 11
Clear and Sunny! Titan Junior High School

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.610
"104th Attack Junior High Festival"

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.700
<b>Cheeseburgers
Kamameshi
Stand</b>

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:28.670
This is our chance!
It's the perfect chance to let everyone know

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.170
how truly magnificent chee-burgs are!

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.340
I won't let it slip away!

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.380
Hey, guys! Are we ready?!

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.340
Not yet! It takes a while for a girl
to get ready, you know!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:42.060
Hey... do we really have to go this far?

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.520
Of course we do!

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:46.600
If we have unpleasant salespeople,
we won't have many customers.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:50.400
Let me point out that last year's
winner is the stand next door.

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:51.310
Yep, yep.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:51.900
"Cheeseburgers Prepared
with Overwhelming Drive"

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.400
It's said that something amazing happens
when they take the lid off the rice pot.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.780
"Home of the Shared Pot,
Kamameshi Stand"

00:02:58.780 --> 00:02:59.030
I heard that last year was crazy with lots
of students rushing to buy <i>kamameshi</i>.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.370
Just so you're aware, Jaeger.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:06.410
We will win this competition without fail,
regardless of what happens.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.920
Keep that in your pampered mind.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.960
Bring it on, Rico!

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:14.550
Our chee-burg won't go down without a fight!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.050
You guys! We're gonna win without fail!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.550
Yeah!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.800
Now, it's time for your makeup,
so close your eyes.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.970
I must admit I have my doubts
about carrying out this plan

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.930
with so little assurance to go on.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.650
If there's anyone who can bring about change,

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:36.230
it's someone capable of
giving up what matters most.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:40.110
If there is tremendous pressure
to outperform last year's winner...

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:44.950
...that person has to be someone
who can give up even his school uniform!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:50.080
Welcome! Would you like
some tasty cheeseburgers?

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:56.710
I can't believe it!

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.170
Snow White
Year 1
Class 4

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.470
Mirror, mirror, on the wall,

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:03.760
who in this land is the most popular of all?

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.850
Snow White is the most popular of them all.

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:07.600
Can't be!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.020
I, <i>Jean</i>, I mean... I, the Queen,
should be the one

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:11.770
who's the most popular of them all!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:15.610
You huntsman there!
Take Snow White out into the woods!

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:18.150
I don't have to tell the rest, right?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.610
Yes, Your Majesty. I'll treat her
to some delicious wild-boar meat.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.570
That's not your line!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:24.490
<b>Brass Band</b>

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.620
<b>Maid Café
Brass Band</b>

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.790
Thanks for waiting!

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.080
I'll put a spell on your omelet rice
to make it tasty, okay?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:32.670
"Café"

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:35.840
Become tasty! Historian!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.460
Please eat it all.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.340
I wanna marry her.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:46.220
I-Is that gonna be okay, Reiner?
I can switch mine with yours if you like.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.270
No, I promised her that I'd eat it all.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.810
Another omelet rice, please!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:56.980
Okay!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.150
I'll put a spell on your omelet rice
to make it tasty, okay?

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.700
Become tasty! Historian!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:02.950
I'm gonna marry her.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.530
Please eat it all.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.240
Hey! No way I'm letting you do that!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.210
Reiner!

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.330
Bertholdt...

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.880
I'll survive this and definitely eat...

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.090
...Christa's omelet rice!

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.680
Yeah, let's eat together.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:25.970
Take this!

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.050
"Spicy Mustard"

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.470
Stop it! You're going overboard!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.680
Reiner... Are you okay?

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:36.440
I don't care. I fulfilled my
responsibility as a soldier, that's all.

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.980
You're kinda cool today, Reiner.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.150
Reiner?!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.660
Don't tell me, that red color is... Tabasco?!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:52.370
I'm not really interested
in this kind of stuff, though.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.620
Then someone else can—

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.710
Huh?! We promised to go together!

00:05:56.920 --> 00:06:01.000
Be honest. You actually
like this kind of stuff, right?

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:06.840
Oh, no! She's so cute!

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:07.090
One drink, 100 yen
Cat Café Snuggle House

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.510
- Whoa! She's fluffy!
Her pads are soft and squishy!
One drink, 100 yen
Cat Café Snuggle House

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:10.890
- What?! What's going on?!

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:11.010
One drink, 100 yen
Cat Café Snuggle House

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.560
Here you go, kitty! It's a toy for you!

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.270
Here, you wanna play with it, don't you?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.820
Here, here, kitty...

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.320
Here, here... Here, here...

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.910
Here, here, here, here...

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.450
That hurt. Watch where you sit!

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:35.710
Ugh! Marlo!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:38.420
Hitch... I didn't realize
that you were a cat lover.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:43.250
Th-That's not true! I'm practicing
how to show animals who the boss is!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:47.010
Here, cat! Kneel down before me!

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:48.970
Oh, no!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.930
Excuse me! I want to buy
all the white meat snacks you have!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.640
Well, they know who the boss is, all right.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.770
Hey, guys!

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:04.730
What'd you like to order?!

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.150
What the hell?!

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.780
Oh, sorry. I just...

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:12.450
Eren! Mikasa! It's time for us to switch places.
Please go to the play now.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.830
I refuse!

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:17.160
But you two are supposed to be
the horse legs in the next scene.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.750
This is a battle!

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.670
Until I can get everyone to understand
how tasty chee-burgs are,

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:24.050
I'll continue to wrap them!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.880
If Eren isn't going, I won't go, either.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:30.140
He'll die an early death unless I'm around.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.470
Your spirit to devote yourselves
to chee-burgs is wonderful!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.600
Though I may not be of much use,
I'll help you with all my might!

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.440
I'll stay, too.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:46.070
There's someone sleeping on the floor!

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:49.110
She's got skin as white as snow
and rosy red cheeks...

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.700
What a beautiful princess.

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:54.330
Hey, isn't it unfair that
you get to just lie there?

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:57.000
I didn't ask for this. Armin isn't here.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.500
I was told that the
chee-burg stand is really popular.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:02.750
Oh, and you look super creepy.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.590
Shut up and say your lines already!

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:11.010
I'll begin by repeating the same
experiment that we've conducted

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.470
in the five previous club activities.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.430
- Tickle, tickle, tickle...

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.180
Biology Club
Research Presentation

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.060
- Hange! Please step back!
- Tickle, tickle, tickle...

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.270
There, Sawney! Doesn't it tickle?
How do you feel?

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:22.900
Hm? What is it?

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.270
What's the matter?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.900
Hange! Please step back!

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:31.030
Almost got me that time, Sawney!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.280
You're seriously gonna die!

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:38.290
Welcome! Ten cheeseburgers, huh?

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:38.580
<b>Cheeseburgers Prepared
with Overwhelming Drive</b>

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.160
Twenty more with extra ketchup, please!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.540
Thirty with no pickles, please!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.000
Mikasa, even you can't handle this many.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.340
Here are thirty <i>kamameshi</i>!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:49.590
"Kamameshi Stand"

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.930
Thank you very much!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:55.890
Ian! Fifty more <i>kamameshi</i>!
Make it so that there's more crunchy rice!

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.560
Got it!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.100
Dammit! As things stand...

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.600
I can do it.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.650
Mikasa?!

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:10.570
She's fine! Take all the orders you can!

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:11.570
Got it!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.530
Hey, how's it going?

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:14.740
Reiner!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:18.540
People're saying that you're
neck and neck with the projected winner.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.700
The entire school is filled with
the mouthwatering scent of chee-burgs.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:24.920
O-Oh, my head is filled with Franz, you say?

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.420
Mine is filled with Hanna, though.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.590
But since Armin didn't come,
Jean is playing Snow White.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:33.800
What?

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:37.720
Hello, dear. Would you like an apple?

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:40.640
Wow, what a tasty looking apple!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.430
How come no one's here to help us?

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.770
The rotation system isn't working.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.610
Here, please have it.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.610
Thank you, old lady.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:53.610
I'll go get help. Until then, hold out somehow.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.030
Okay. I'm counting on you.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:07.420
Snow White is dead! I'm the one
who's the most popular of all now!

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:09.880
Sorry, Jean! Just wait until I come back!

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:15.050
<b>Biology Club    Research Presentation</b>

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.720
Hange! There's no need for <i>you</i> to laugh!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.140
How can I <i>not</i> laugh?!

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:23.810
Beane is... Beane is so ticklish!

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:26.520
Beane! Hang in there! Stay strong!

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.190
Whoa! Look, Moblit!

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:32.190
Beane's face looks crazy!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.820
Hurry up and sketch his face!

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:36.150
Is his face going back to normal, though?!

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.410
Don't you have any compassion, Hange?

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:40.740
"104th Attack Junior High Festival"

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:41.990
Whoa!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:43.450
What a long line!

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:44.500
"B-Grade Gourmet Competition"

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:44.660
<b>Chee-burg line ends here</b>

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.870
This is the end of the line
for the chee-burg stand!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:47.080
<b>Chee-burg line ends here</b>

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:47.500
Conny!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:48.880
Oh, hey, Marco. Good timing.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.920
We're having trouble with the play!
Hurry up and—

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.340
I gotta go to the bathroom,
so take care of the line for me. Later!

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:55.510
Hey, Conny!

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:58.340
Hey, Marco. Is this the snack stand
that Eren and the others are running?

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.850
Ah... yes, it is.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.850
We had to wait this long.
I bet it's really good.

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:07.350
You can't tell which tastes better
just by looking at the length of the lines.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:10.190
I heard that they've got
a super cute salesperson here.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.360
Thanks for waiting!

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:13.820
A-Armin?!

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:17.610
Here are the four cheeseburgers you ordered.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.700
Armin! What's with that getup?!

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.370
Don't tell me the cute salesperson
they were talking about is...

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.660
How dare you make us wait!
I've got a delicate sense of taste.

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.710
I don't care if there's
a long line or not, I—

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:32.040
Just shut up and eat!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:33.750
Th-This is...

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.760
...a <i>marriage</i> between rich flavored cheese
and juices flowing from the burger!

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:40.590
Beating low-temperature aged beef
with a knife probably made—

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:44.350
Talking while eating is a
guaranteed way to bite your tongue.

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:45.390
Rico!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.720
It'll be done soon!

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:47.930
Got it.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.270
The way to make tasty rice is...

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.730
"Start cooking at low heat
and then later switch to high heat.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:55.070
Don't remove the lid even if a baby cries!"

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:59.240
Considering their current heat level,
it's just a matter of time before it's done.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.030
Eren, let's do a limited-time sale!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.370
Huh?! What's the deal, Armin?!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.330
Are you saying that we should
practically give away our chee-burgs?!

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:09.870
We won't drop the price,
but we'll double the amount of cheese.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.920
Double cheeseburgers?!

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:15.250
Excuse me, I'm going to get a
stomachache right around that time,

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.090
so can I go stand in line?

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:17.590
No.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.260
Please!

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:22.090
When you look at the length of the line,
it appears that we're winning.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.430
Yeah, for now. But the turning point
of the competition comes

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.930
when they take the lid off that rice pot.

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:31.850
Yeah, the smell of
freshly-cooked rice is the best.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.940
We'll make it disappear
with the smell of our chee-burgs!

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:37.070
Guys! Let's do it!

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:37.280
<b>Cheeseburgers Prepared
with Overwhelming Drive</b>

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.650
Yeah!

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:43.660
Oh, Princess! How beautiful you are!

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:49.250
Your raven-black hair and red lips...
You look as if you're only asleep.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:54.130
Dammit! I can't call myself a prince
if I can't even kiss that thing!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:58.840
O-Oh, Princess!
Let me k-kiss you to wake you up!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.970
Wh-What the hell?!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:08.970
What's that?!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.480
It's coming from the stand next door!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.640
Is it possibly done?!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.400
Home of the Shared Pot,
Kamameshi Stand is about to...

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:16.690
"Home of the Shared Pot,
Kamameshi Stand"

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.820
Look! They're opening the lid!

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.740
Now!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:27.530
Attention, everyone! Our chee-burg stand
will start a limited-time sale!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:32.540
Double cheeseburgers with double
the amount of cheese for the same price!

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.420
A crazy amount of customers are coming!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.760
Sasha, what'd you just put in your pocket?

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.050
I didn't put any chee-burgs...

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.680
They're coming!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:46.890
Three double cheeseburgers!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:47.600
I'll buy ten!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:48.510
I'll buy seventeen!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:49.680
I'll buy two.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.100
Let me have at least one!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:51.850
No.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.640
Not bad, Year 1.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.690
Ian! Let's open the lid!

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:58.900
What's that?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:13:59.150
<b>Chee-burg
line ends here
Kamameshi
Stand</b>

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.400
What's that noise?

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:05.740
Nile, deploy the entire staff immediately!

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:08.030
We should assume that Titans have appeared.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.240
Wha—?!

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:17.210
Everyone evacuate! Titans are coming!

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:20.840
Eren!

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:24.050
You damn Titans! I'll destroy you!

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:26.720
What's that stupid chee-burg bastard doing?!

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.260
Huh?

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.470
This is bad! They're after... the snack stands!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.400
Our sausage stand is...!

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.730
Our octopus dumpling stand!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:41.270
What do you think you're doing?!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.730
Don't act alone, Eren!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:48.780
How dare they mess with the snack stands!
I won't... I won't let them get away!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:58.580
Eren!

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.840
Dammit!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.340
Give them back!

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:09.720
My... Our chee-burgs!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:13.600
Damn you Titans!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:50.440
Humanity was suddenly reminded that day...

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:54.490
...of the terror of being at their mercy...

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.990
Of the humiliation of
being trapped inside a cage...

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:00.000
Attack! Titan Junior High School
